SURFACE (parity with the web source — no scope narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native files (allowed scope: apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/BatteryGaugeWidget.*):
  BatteryGaugeWidget.swift          — SwiftUI surface: header (freshness + refresh) + loading/empty/
                                      error/content states inside a glass widget shell
  BatteryGaugeWidget.Model.swift    — P1/S8 state-holder seam, DTO, @Observable model, P1/S11
                                      telemetry seam, registry, P1/S10 i18n facade
  BatteryGaugeWidget.Adapter.swift  — pure projector (DTO→projection): colour bands, fmtNumber gauge
                                      readout, "%" unit, charging caption, accessibility
  BatteryGaugeWidget.Views.swift    — BatteryGaugeWidgetRadialGauge (←web RadialGauge in
                                      WidgetGaugeHero), BatteryGaugeWidgetChargingChip (←`⚡ Charging`),
                                      loading skeleton, connectivity banner, band→colour
  BatteryGaugeWidget.Previews.swift — per-state + per-size #Previews (DEBUG only)
  BatteryGaugeWidget.strings        — P1/S10 catalog contribution (table "BatteryGaugeWidget")
  BatteryGaugeWidget.Tests.swift    — band + format + projector + phase + model + telemetry +
                                      registry + a11y tests

Data binds via the shared P1/S8 `BatteryGaugeWidgetSource` seam (the production app wires the
`VehicleStore` active vehicle + the vehicle-state `Resource` + `SettingsStore`; previews/tests use the
in-memory source). No HTTP in the view. Web hooks reproduced: useVehicles, useVehicleState
(GET /vehicles/{id}/state), useTranslation.

Colour bands ported verbatim from the web `batteryColor`: >50 #10b981 (green), >20 #f59e0b (amber),
else #ef4444 (red); the `!state` grey #374151 branch backs the `unknown` band (surface shows the empty
state). Gauge readout = fmtNumber(clamped 0..100, integer→0 / else precision) + "%"; "Battery" caption
below the ring; `⚡ Charging` caption shown when is_charging (and !compact), matching WidgetGaugeHero.

States reproduced from the web source (every state renders — no hidden surface):
  loading (skeleton), empty ("No battery data"), error (retry affordance), stale (chip + retained
  gauge, auto-refresh), offline (chip + cached gauge), content (radial gauge + charging caption).

i18n keys (all from source, resolved through the P1/S10 facade; no English literals in code):
  widget.battery, widget.charging, widget.noBattery + widget.battery.{title,description}; plus native
  chrome (live/stale/offline/refresh/retry/loading/emptyHint/errorTitle/banners) + the a11y template.
Telemetry: `view.opened` (screen_view) with surface slug `BatteryGaugeWidget` (P1/S11 seam).

Registry parity (registry/battery.ts → "battery-gauge"): category `battery`, default 1×2, min 1×2,
max 2×40 — registration + size clamp asserted in BatteryGaugeWidgetRegistryTests.

